                        {
                            "id":  "ann_1",
                            "type":  "note",
                            "text":  "Compute Shader TOP — Sobel Edge Filter\n\nReads an input texture (gn_tex0) via sampler2D and writes\nSobel edge-detected output to the storage image.\n\nThe \u0027strength\u0027 push constant becomes an inspector parameter.\nResolution is inherited from the input NoiseTOP automatically.",
